=== Tenser's Weapon Box ===
* 10 units of 10000 {{Item|Sentient XP|Sentient Experience}}
* 20 {{Item|Sentience Toolkit}}s
* 2 {{Item|Glamered Weapon Aura}}s
* 5 {{Item|Mirror of Glamering|Mirrors of Glamering}}
* 2 {{Item|Lasting Oil of Strengthening|Lasting Olis of Strengthening}} (When used, this oil prevents all items from taking durability damage for 3 hours.)

The box is unbound. Once open, all items inside are bound to account.

